{"seq":52,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2134"},"reason":"The price claim 'around 20 euros a pair' could not be confirmed for 2011 and is outdated: the Mes Chaussettes Rouges shop sells the Gammarelli socks for 23 euros in October 2026, so the body now says 'as of 2026 about 23 euros'. Also corrected 'scarlet and purple cardinals' socks': red is the cardinals' colour, purple the bishops' (as the shop itself says).","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.meschaussettesrouges.com/collections/chaussettes-gammarelli"},{"url":"https://www.meschaussettesrouges.com/"},{"url":"https://catholicherald.co.uk/socks-from-papal-tailor-sold-online/"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",872],["-","socks,"],["+","socks"],["=",1],["+","– "],["=",4],["+","socks of cardinals "],["=",2],["+","the "],["=",2],["-","cardinals'"],["+","ones"],["=",1],["-","socks,"],["+","of"],["=",1],["+","bishops – "],["=",24],["-","for"],["+","(as"],["=",1],["-","around"],["+","of"],["=",1],["-","20"],["+","2026"],["=",1],["-","euros "],["=",2],["-","pair,"],["+","pair"],["=",1],["+","costs about 23 euros there), "],["=",193]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",818],["-","Socken,"],["+","Socken"],["=",1],["+","– "],["=",4],["+","der Kardinäle "],["=",2],["+","die "],["=",2],["-","Kardinalssocken,"],["+","der"],["=",1],["+","Bischöfe –, "],["=",14],["-","ab"],["+","seit"],["=",3],["+","verkauft (Stand 2026 "],["=",2],["-","rund"],["+","etwa"],["=",1],["-","20"],["+","23"],["=",5],["-","Paar"],["+","Paar)"],["=",1],["-","verkaufte "],["=",18],["-","brachte."],["+","bringt."],["=",168]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",776],["+","кардинальские "],["=",4],["-","кардинальские"],["+","епископские,"],["=",1],["-","носки, "],["=",22],["-","примерно"],["+","(по"],["=",1],["-","по"],["+","состоянию"],["=",1],["-","20"],["+","на"],["=",1],["-","евро"],["+","2026"],["=",1],["-","за"],["+","год"],["=",1],["-","пару,"],["+","пара"],["=",1],["+","стоит там ок