{"seq":54,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w10715"},"reason":"The printed question said the socks 'now cost only 20 euros a pair online'; in 2026 they cost 23 euros, so the price is dropped and the question asks about the item the Paris shop has sold online since 2011 (card words kept in cardText).","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.meschaussettesrouges.com/collections/chaussettes-gammarelli"},{"url":"https://catholicherald.co.uk/socks-from-papal-tailor-sold-online/"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which item of clothing, made by the tailoring firm Gammarelli since 1798, now costs only 20 euros a pair online?","new":"Which item of clothing from the papal tailor Gammarelli (founded in 1798) has been sold online by a Paris shop since 2011 and became a cult item among fashion lovers?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welches Kleidungsstück, das vom Schneiderbetrieb Gammarelli seit 1798 hergestellt wird, kostet jetzt online nur noch 20 Euro pro Paar?","new":"Welches Kleidungsstück des päpstlichen Schneiders Gammarelli (gegründet 1798) wird seit 2011 von einem Pariser Onlinehändler verkauft und wurde unter Modefans zum Kultobjekt?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какой предмет одежды, который портновская фирма Gammarelli выпускает с 1798 года, теперь стоит в интернете всего 20 евро за пару?","new":"Какой предмет одежды от папского портного Gammarelli (основан в 1798 году) с 2011 года продаёт парижский интернет-магазин, и он стал культовым у любителей моды?"},{"field":"cardText","new":"Welches Kleidungsstück, das vom Schneiderbetrieb Gammarelli seit 1798 hergestellt wird, kostet jetzt online nur noch 20 Euro pro Paar?"}],"hash":"47826581faaa","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"aee593f2f687be94c36d74e5c0e93871cf58aca55c128f0b2c6f685a56a0b454"},
